  "notes": [
    "The diamond routed flash to the same unrestricted code since creation (facet 0xf21e49ee); the cut at block 193149212 installed facet 0xc6d7b37f and sets the age (rule 7). No flash call minted RICO to a third-party target before the anchor (scanned from the diamond's creation).",
    "Campaign: copycat 0xb7025bd9 called flash 28 times in the next 2.5 hours, pulling approvals from users and the deployer and approving itself for the bank's Uniswap V3 position 1214918; the referenced txs transferred, decreased and collected that position. The deployer's 16 positions it also took held no liquidity.",
    "Victims are the diamond and every approver drained, netted per tx (loss.mjs). wstETH has no Arbitrum price and is valued at the 2,092.17 USDC.e the anchor's swap realised; position 1214918 at the 4,796.55 USDC it yielded (its 1.81 RICO, like the 1.818 RICO taken from the deployer, is valued at zero)."
